; An open's invalid booking method is reported when its rule reduces. A
; syntax error on a line continuing the open drops it before that, so only
; the syntax error is reported, after a body comment too; the last open is
; kept and reported.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Before "BOGUS"
  Equity:Opening

2020-01-01 open Assets:Tagged "fifo"
  #tag

2020-01-01 open Assets:Commented "fifo"
  ; body comment
  Equity:Opening

2020-01-01 open Assets:Invalid "fifo"
  ; one comment
  ; another comment
  foo

2020-01-01 open Assets:Kept "BOGUS"
